                "text": "Today is Election Day and voting is an opportunity to exercise your greatest liberty and make your voice is heard.\n\nDue to hurricane damage, some voting sites have changed in Western North Carolina. If you\u2019re unsure where your Election Day polling place is located, you can visit\u00a0this link\u00a0and put in your address:\u00a0https://t.co/toMszlNQ8m\u00a0\n\nPlease note that voting on Election Day is not the same as early voting, and you must go to your assigned polling place.\n\nFor the love of democracy, get out and vote.",
