                "text": "MYTH:\u00a0 H.R.1 cuts the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program.\n\nFACT: H.R.1 promotes\u00a0accountability and prioritizes the value\u00a0of work within the SNAP program. These updates will save taxpayers an estimated $130 million by\u00a0eliminating\u00a0waste, closing loopholes, and reinforcing work requirements. H.R.1 strengthens SNAP for those who truly need it while promoting pathways to employment and restoring integrity to the program.",
